ce-book-text-tiefling-gambit = [head=1]Tiefling Gambit[/head]
    Recommended 3+ players

    •[bold]Goal:[/bold] Roll the highest number of points in a round

    •[bold]Gameplay:[/bold] Players place bets which will be placed into the pot in the center of the table.
    (For example, each of 4 players decides to bet [color=chocolate]5c[/color], in which case the pot is [color=chocolate]20c[/color])

    After determining the pot size, players take turns rolling a die clockwise; [bold]Whoever rolls the highest — wins.[/bold]

    If multiple players roll the same number, the [bold]STORM[/bold] rules come into effect. Those players re-roll to finally determine the winner.

    •[bold]Gambit: [/bold]After the initial rolls are complete, players who rolled a one on the die during the initial roll may choose to buy an extra re-roll for half the original bet. In the case of a STORM, gambit rolls are made [bold]BEFORE[/bold] the re-roll, [color=red]not after[/color]
